================================================================================
Third-party attribution (ideas, patterns, and code-level adaptations absorbed)
================================================================================

This kit absorbs ideas and patterns from the open-source projects listed below.
Where code-level adaptations exist, they are decoupled from each project's
original infrastructure and re-implemented to fit our skill kit model.

The full Acknowledgements section in `README.md` describes which artifacts were
absorbed, where they live in this kit, and what was deliberately not adopted.

---

